/**
 * DIGIT Pro Run11.1 — defined formulas for every placement that was pending (owner decision 2026-11-11: nothing stays
 * "formula pending", "owner policy", "server only" or "missing"; the 78 FORMULA_TO_DEFINE get a defined formula).
 *
 * Each entry below is the approved definition of one PLACEMENTS_448 id, written over native records and the shared Core
 * control records (Control Policy tolerances, Close Tasks, Invoice Disputes, Correction Tasks, Asset Custody):
 *  - kpi / chart / queue: a section element evaluated by the same engine as every other figure (sections.ts evalKpi /
 *    evalChart / evalQueue: role read + User Permission, company fail-closed, drill to exactly the counted records);
 *  - adopt: the placement's candidate figure already on the page is the definition (same basis, stated in `f`);
 *  - action: the contextual action now opens a native form, filtered list, report or Pro screen;
 *  - doc: the document placement is served by the named Pro screen.
 * `f` is the formula in plain words (English, Arabic); it is shown as the figure's basis line.
 * run11.ts applies this table to PLACEMENTS / RUN11_QUEUES / RUN11_ACTIONS; workspaceSpec() adds the figures to the
 * workspace, so the exported section contract (frappeSectionExport) keeps the original SPECS.
 */
